**Option 1: Flexbox (Easiest)**
```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center; /* horizontal */
  align-items: center;     /* vertical */
  min-height: 100vh;
}
```

**Option 2: Grid (2-line flex 💅)**
```css
.container {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  min-height: 100vh;
}
```
Boom. Centered. No 2012 float hacks needed 😮‍💨.

